WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-World - Free-fall Zone, desperate.

2
00:00:05.300 --> 00:00:06.300 align:center
Lyra: Falling! Hold!

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.600 align:center
Echo Shard: Let it go. Ease the passing.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:10.900 align:center
Lyra: Never! Not this memory!

5
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:12.200 align:center
Kael: The pull... resist.

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-World - Precipice of a Stable Platform, urgent.

7
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.800 align:center
Lyra: That platform! Almost there!

8
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:24.100 align:center
Kael: It sees me... the Loom.

9
00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.400 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A stray thread. Return to the weave.

10
00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.700 align:center
Lyra: No! Not Kael's shard!

11
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:36.000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Collapsing Memory-World - Crumbling Bridge, desperate.

12
00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.300 align:center
Lyra: Got it! Almost!

13
00:00:37.600 --> 00:00:38.600 align:center
Kael: Thank you... Lyra.

14
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:39.900 align:center
Lyra: My turn. Distraction!

15
00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.200 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Insignificant.

16
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:46.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinth of Broken Memory-Shelves, tense.

17
00:00:46.800 --> 00:00:48.800 align:center
Lyra: Which way? It's too quiet.

18
00:00:49.100 --> 00:00:51.100 align:center
Kael: The resonance... draws it.

19
00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:53.400 align:center
Lyra: I know! Can't hide it forever.

20
00:00:53.700 --> 00:00:54.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Closer. Always closer.

21
00:00:55.1000 --> 00:00:59.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinth - Dead End, urgent.

22
00:01:00.300 --> 00:01:02.300 align:center
Lyra: Dead end! Damn it!

23
00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:03.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: No escape. Yield.

24
00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.900 align:center
Lyra: Not this shard! Not yet!

25
00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:07.200 align:center
Kael: Use it... Lyra.

26
00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:12.500 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Labyrinth - Escape Route, desperate.

27
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.800 align:center
Lyra: No choice. Not this one.

28
00:01:15.100 --> 00:01:16.100 align:center
Kael: A sacrifice...

29
00:01:16.400 --> 00:01:17.400 align:center
Lyra: Move! Now!

30
00:01:17.700 --> 00:01:19.700 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Futile. The path re-weaves.

31
00:01:20.1000 --> 00:01:25.1000 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Hidden Nook - Temporary Refuge, dread.

32
00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:29.300 align:center
Lyra: Safe... for now. What is this place?

33
00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.600 align:center
Kael: A console... for me.

34
00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:33.900 align:center
Lyra: You're a key? To what?

35
00:01:35.200 --> 00:01:40.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Hidden Nook - Console Interface, dread.

36
00:01:40.500 --> 00:01:42.500 align:center
Lyra: No... it can't be.

37
00:01:42.800 --> 00:01:45.800 align:center
Kael: To open the way... I must be spent.

38
00:01:46.100 --> 00:01:48.100 align:center
Lyra: All of you? Everything?

39
00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:50.400 align:center
Kael: My purpose. To guide you.

40
00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:55.700 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Console Chamber - Trapped, desperate.

41
00:01:55.1000 --> 00:01:56.1000 align:center
Lyra: Kael... I can't.

42
00:01:57.300 --> 00:01:59.300 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: The scent of hesitation. The end.

43
00:01:59.600 --> 00:02:01.600 align:center
Kael: Live... Lyra. Remember me.

44
00:02:01.900 --> 00:02:03.900 align:center
Lyra: Forgive me. Forgive me!

45
00:02:05.200 --> 00:02:10.200 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Newly Opened Path - Unstable Corridor, dread.

46
00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:11.500 align:center
Lyra: Kael... gone.

47
00:02:11.800 --> 00:02:13.800 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: A void. A new emptiness.

48
00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.100 align:center
Lyra: Just me now. Alone.

49
00:02:17.400 --> 00:02:22.400 align:center
♪ under the cover of darkness, in Edge of the Path - Void, dread.

50
00:02:22.700 --> 00:02:23.700 align:center
Lyra: Out. Free...

51
00:02:23.1000 --> 00:02:25.1000 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: You think so, Lyra?

52
00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.300 align:center
Lyra: What? Who...?

53
00:02:27.600 --> 00:02:30.600 align:center
Loom of Oblivion: Your destination. The Core Archive. We await.

54
00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:31.900 align:center
Lyra: No... they know.
